        "original_id": "42de5834-3831-5c17-8d74-dbc17d4495d3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nick Saban, Justin Vincent\n- Organizations: LSU Tigers, Louisiana State University, Oklahoma Sooners\n- Places: Tiger Stadium, Baton Rouge, Louisiana\n- Events: 2004 Sugar Bowl, 2004 BCS National Championship game\n- Topics: 2003 LSU Tigers football team\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2003 season, Nick Saban coached the LSU Tigers.\n- In the 2003 season, the LSU Tigers played their home games at Tiger Stadium in Baton Rouge, Louisiana.\n- In the 2004 Sugar Bowl, the LSU Tigers won the BCS National Championship, which was their second championship, by defeating the Oklahoma Sooners 21-14.\n- Justin Vincent played college football for Louisiana State University.\n- Justin Vincent was the MVP of the 2004 BCS National Championship game.",
